<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting Qantas Customer Care.<br />
<br />
We believe a great journey starts with a great booking experience, so I’m sorry to hear about the -<em><strong>error with your booking/give details here</strong></em>- and the impact that this had on your planned arrival in to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}}.<br />
<br />
We’ve always been committed to providing customers with a premium, professional and helpful service, so I understand your disappointment on this occasion.<br />
<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
I’m sorry to hear about the unexpected expense you incurred while delayed overnight and understand how frustrating this must have been. I would be happy to look at reimbursing this for you, so I’ve attached a form for you to provide your bank account details so that we can process any refund.<br />
<br />
When returning the completed form and any supporting documentation, please reply directly to this email. This will make sure the information is attached to your current file.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-if a frequent flyer</strong></em>&nbsp;<br />
<br />
In the meantime, as a gesture of goodwill, I’ve credited {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account. You can use the points towards flights, food and wine through Qantas Wine, as well as a range of products from Qantas Marketplace.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-if not a Frequent Flyer</strong></em>&nbsp;<br />
<br />
In the meantime, I’d like to arrange a credit of {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to you. If you’re not already a member, you can join free using this <a href="https://www.qantas.com/en-au/frequent-flyer/join/code/familyfree">link</a>.<br />
<br />
You can use the points towards flights, food and wine through Qantas Wine, or a range of products from Qantas Marketplace. You can let us know what your Frequent Flyer number is by replying to this email, so we can credit these points to your account as soon as possible.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion&nbsp;</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with an exceptional experience from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I’ve passed on your feedback to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience and I hope we deliver an exceptional service next time you fly with Qantas.</p>
</body>
</html>